<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52379" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰκοτεχν-ία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>base artifice,
			malpractice</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heraclit.
				[129]
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRein.</u>
				16.26
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				669.55
			</span></i> (Egypt, <span class="entity">i A. D.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2712.15
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Mylasa</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.636
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				10.2
			</span></i> (pl.): freq. in pl., as law-term, <i>fraudulent</i> or
				<i>malicious conspiracy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακοτεχνιῶν διαδικάζεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					936d
				</span></i>
			; esp. <i>subornation of perjury</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				47.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				49.56
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόλοι καὶ ἐπιορκίαι καὶ
			κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bad art</i>, applied to forensic oratory by <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				51
			</span></i>: generally, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.228b
			</span></i>: esp. in Rhet., <i>false artifice</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				27
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				247
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Par.</u>
				27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				14.631f
			</span></i>: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονὰς καὶ κ. εἰσάγων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					7.3.7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
